{
  "$comment": "What the agent sandbox images (Dockerfile) install: everything here goes into both the standard and the full image, \"office\" only into the full one. Source for SANDBOX_IMAGE_TOOLS / SANDBOX_NODE_PACKAGES / SANDBOX_PYTHON_PACKAGES in supabase/functions/_shared/ai-workforce/sandbox.ts (tests/unit/ai-workforce/sandboxImage.test.ts keeps them in step) and for the Clateway Claude Code plugin's scanner. Node packages are global (NODE_PATH) and linked into /workspace/node_modules at sandbox start, so they work without network.",
  "apt": [
    "git", "curl", "ca-certificates", "jq", "unzip", "zip",
    "ffmpeg", "sox", "libsox-fmt-mp3", "imagemagick", "librsvg2-bin", "graphviz", "libimage-exiftool-perl",
